1 OCCU Professor
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} www.whonamedit.com skriver:  
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert (Robin) Sanno Fåhræus
2 CONT
2 CONT Swedish pathologist and haematologist, born October 15, 1888, Stockholm; died September 18, 1968, Uppsala.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Sanno (Robin) Fåhræus was the son of Klas Walter Fåhræus and the actress Olga Kristina Augusta Björkegren. He attended the Karolinska institutet in Stockholm and received his doctorate in 1922. The same year he was habilita
2 CONC ted for experimental pathology at this institution, and in 1928 he assumed the chair of pathological anatomy in Uppsala. 
2 CONT
2 CONT At he founding meeting of The International Society of Hemorheology in July, 1966, Robin Fåhræus became the first to receive the highest honour of the Society, the Poiseuille medal. The medal is named for the French physician and 
2 CONC physiologist Jean-Louis-Marie Poiseuille (1797-1869), remembered for Hagen- Poiseuille law, a mathematical expression to describe flow of water in narrow bore glass tube. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bibliography:
2 CONT
2 CONT Läkekonstens historia - En översikt. 3 volumes, Stockholm 1944-1950. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Historia de la medicina. Gustavo Gili, Barcelona, 1956. 724 pages.
2 CONT
2 CONT Die Grundlagen der neueren Humoralpathologie. Die frühe Geschichte der Mikrozirkulation. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Virchows Archiv für pathologische Anatomie und Physiologie und für klinische Medizin, 1960, 333: 176-189. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rudolf Virchow. Opuscula medica, Stockholm, 1963, 8: 229-239. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengt Ludvig Bergenheim (1898–) & R. S. Fahraeus:
2 CONT
2 CONT Über spontane Hämolysinbildung im Blut, unter besonderer Berücksichtigung der Physiologie der Milz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zeitschrift für die Gesamte Experimentelle Medizin, Berlin, 1936, 97: 555-587.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lysolechtin found in normal blood.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Brage Nordlander:
2 CONT
2 CONT Nils Fåhraeus: mannen med ett öga för det vackra och det ovanliga. Medicinhistorisk paus. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In: Läkartidningen, July 11, 2002, 99 (28-29): 3046-3047.
2 CONT
