1 NAME Ellen Nanci Maria /Bratt/
2 GIVN Ellen Nanci Maria
2 SURN Bratt
2 _MARNM Dickson
1 NAME Nancy Dickson (Bratt)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 JAN 1880
2 PLAC Karlsborg
2 ADDR
3 STAE Västergötland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 FEB 1965
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
3 STAE Uppland
