1 NAME David Otto /Francke/
2 GIVN David Otto
2 _MARNM Francke
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 SEP 1825
2 ADDR
3 CITY Göteborg
3 STAE Bohuslän
3 CTRY Sweden
