2 DATE 28 APR 1872
2 PLAC Hörningsholm
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Mörkö
3 CITY Södertälje
3 STAE Södermanland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 JUN 1957
2 PLAC Hörningsholm
