1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hasselrot, Carl Rudolf''' b. 1855. Student 1873, theology graduate 1879, ordination and clergy the same year as chaplain in Habo 1886, in Bo 1887, in Broddetorp 1890, in Levene 1898, Vicar in Långared 1898 and t
2 CONC hen in Adolf Fredrik's congregation in Stockholm beginning 1909. Was a contributor of “Väktaren” starting 1883, a conservative political and ecclesiastical periodical; editor of the same between 1884–1888. Strongly favored the tem
2 CONC perance movement and “Ungdomsrörelsen” in Sweden, a semi-political movement c. 1890–1920 that influenced social development and the development of ideas, but which is virtually unknown in contemporary Sweden. Died 29 August. ¹
2 CONT
2 CONT * * the year after his fathers death.
2 CONT * oo 1882 with Sigrid Sofia Aline Georgii (1852–1927)
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References / Notes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dahlgren, Anna. (2009). “[http://hasselrot.org/index-filer/PDF/HSFMB_09.pdf Historien om Mia]” (PDF), in ''[http://www.hasselrot.org Hasselrotska släktföreningen],'' Medlemsblad 40, December.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ekman, Anders. (2008). “[http://hasselrot.org/index-filer/PDF/HSFMB-08.pdf Hanna Dahlgren om kyrkoherden Axel Hasselrot (1845 – 1921)]” (PDF), in ''[http://www.hasselrot.org Hasselrotska släktföreningen],'' Medlemsblad 39, Decem
2 CONC ber.
2 CONT
2 CONT * “[http://hasselrot.org/index-filer/PDF/MathiasPehrCarl.pdf Mathias’ och Märthas barn och barnbarn]” (PDF), ''[http://www.hasselrot.org Hasselrotska släktföreningen].''
2 CONT
2 CONT * ''Svenskt biografiskt lexikon (SBL)'', s.v. “[http://www.nad.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=12648 Hasselrot, släkt]” [Kinship]. (accessed June 16, 2012).
2 CONT
2 CONT * Västra Götalandsregionen, Västarvet, image ID [http://www9.vgregion.se/vastarvet/objekt.aspx?id=VGM_B145033_361 VGM_B145033_361]
2 CONT
2 CONT # ''Projekt Runeberg. Svenska Dagbladets Årsbok (1924–1941) / Femte årgången (händelserna 1927) / Märkligare dödsfall i Sverige 1927'', s.v. “Carl Rudolf Hasselrot”, p. [http://runeberg.org/svda/1927/0256.html 254]. (accessed June
2 CONC  16, 2012).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Mog ex 1873, dim ex, prakt teol ex samt prästv 1879, kyrkoherde i Långared fg, Skara stift 1899 samt Adolf Fredriks församling i Stockholm 1909.
2 CONT
